WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.420
Speaker 1: Marjorie Taylor GREENE Yes, the
radical and repugnant Republican Congresswoman

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:12.880
Marjorie Taylor GREENE is reportedly being
considered to be Donald Trump's running mate

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.450
in 2024.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:21.550
For months, reports Business Insider, Trump
has repeatedly discussed choosing Marjorie

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:26.949
Taylor GREENE as his 2024 running mate.

00:00:26.949 --> 00:00:35.000
This is per Robert Draper of the New York
Times Magazine, as told to The Daily Beast.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.450
Trump is considering Green.

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:43.290
This won't come as a surprise to you because
of her unflagging loyalty to him.

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:47.850
Speaking on this week's episode of The Daily
Beast's The New Abnormal podcast, Draper claimed

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:51.200
the discussions have been ongoing for months.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.750
It's been discussed repeatedly.

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:59.960
Now, to be fair, I mean, how many of these
conversations has Trump had with other people?

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:04.920
What is Trump concerned about most of all
in a VP after the Mike Pence experience?

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.240
Loyalty.

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:07.570
Loyalty.

00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:12.580
Trump needs someone who will, quote, fight
for him to overturn a presidential election.

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:17.950
He has every reason to expect that GREENE
would be by his side and would be his proximate

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:19.610
warrior.

00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:25.390
Earlier this week, Green told Draper she's
discussed with Trump the possibility of serving

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:26.750
as his running mate.

00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:32.270
She said she would be honored to serve, but
the GOP establishment would not want it.

00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:35.810
So listen, she's completely out of her mind.

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:36.810
Crazy.

00:01:36.810 --> 00:01:40.470
She is.

00:01:40.470 --> 00:01:41.950
Loyal is not even the right word.

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:46.950
But yes, she's unendingly loyal to Trump in
the sense of following whatever disastrous

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:53.280
instinct or talking point Trump is distracted
by that week as the latest shiny object.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:54.280
I don't know.

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:59.320
On the one hand, why Trump thinks it would
help him to have Marjorie Taylor GREENE as

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:00.789
