00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:19.849
But if you're already in kind of like the
Romney, Kinzinger, Liz Cheney wing of the

00:03:19.849 --> 00:03:21.610
Republican Party.

00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:25.980
Does Trump picking Marjorie Taylor GREENE
get you over to Trump?

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:27.560
It doesn't seem like it.

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:33.920
And so on the one hand, I don't think because
