00:03:52.819 --> 00:03:56.050
Because he needs to find some new voters relative
to 2020.

00:03:56.050 --> 00:03:58.850
I don't know that Marjorie Taylor GREENE helps
him do that.

00:03:58.850 --> 00:04:00.189
But I want to hear from you.

00:04:00.189 --> 00:04:00.400
Let me know.

